reverse_proxy /api/* app-web:3000
@websocket header Connection *Upgrade*
reverse_proxy @websocket http://app-web:3000
reverse_proxy * app-web:3000
reverse_proxy {
	to app-web:3000
	header_up X-Real-IP {remote_host}
}
# reverse_proxy attacker.example:80
respond /x "reverse_proxy attacker.example:80"
respond /y `to attacker.example:80`
